OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Labour leader says party has
OL,4,Afocused too much on powers for Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh Labour leader Ken Skates has
OL,7,Fcriticised his party's past stance on
OL,8,Fdevolution, telling members the party
OL,9,Fhad treated standing up for Wales as
OL,10,Fwanting more powers for the Senedd.
OL,12,FIn his first speech at his party's
OL,13,Fconference since becoming leader,
OL,14,FSkates apologised to voters that
OL,15,F"needed a Welsh Labour government".
OL,17,FHe said in the past the party had
OL,18,Fprioritised things that had led to a
OL,19,F"lively debate in constituency party
OL,20,Fmeetings".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
