OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Labour leader says party has
OL,4,Afocused too much on powers for Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FSkates spoke after Burnham suggested
OL,7,Fthe party may not have devolved enough
OL,8,Fpowers to communities when it ran the
OL,9,FCardiff administration.
